{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite", "body": [{"content": "YouTube", "from": 0.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 1, "to": 0.44}, {"content": "发生了什么", "from": 0.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 2, "to": 1.42}, {"content": "我现在正式成为YouTube上的Corporate Surf", "from": 1.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 3, "to": 4.78}, {"content": "今天我们将带来另一个Kovacs瞄准教程", "from": 4.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 4, "to": 8.82}, {"content": "但在深入Kovacs之前", "from": 8.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 5, "to": 10.82}, {"content": "让我们聊聊这位人物", "from": 10.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 6, "to": 12.55}, {"content": "亚里士多德", "from": 12.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 7, "to": 13.69}, {"content": "亚里士多德说事物的善在于其本质的实现", "from": 13.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 8, "to": 19.49}, {"content": "那么YouTube上Corporate Surf的本质是什么", "from": 19.49, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 9, "to": 23.57}, {"content": "嗯", "from": 23.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 10, "to": 24.24}, {"content": "让我先告诉你它不是什么", "from": 24.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 11, "to": 26.6}, {"content": "这个频道不旨在帮助你在Apex中变得优秀", "from": 26.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 12, "to": 30.9}, {"content": "或Counter Strike、Valorant等游戏", "from": 30.9, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 13, "to": 33.74}, {"content": "它也不在这里教你技巧", "from": 33.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 14, "to": 36.74}, {"content": "或如何修正技巧", "from": 36.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 15, "to": 38.34}, {"content": "那我的频道到底是什么", "from": 38.34, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 16, "to": 40.18}, {"content": "那我的视频又是什么", "from": 40.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 17, "to": 41.89}, {"content": "你可能会看到它们涉及几个方面", "from": 41.89, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 18, "to": 44.07}, {"content": "但我的三大核心是训练优化方法", "from": 44.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 19, "to": 48.29}, {"content": "实验性训练计划", "from": 48.29, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 20, "to": 50.69}, {"content": "比如我的瞄准连贯法", "from": 50.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 21, "to": 52.35}, {"content": "还有动作专业化或动作优化", "from": 52.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 22, "to": 56.53}, {"content": "但所有这些都特定于Kovacs本身", "from": 56.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 23, "to": 60.33}, {"content": "提升控场追踪技巧的最佳方式是看VT的视频", "from": 60.33, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 24, "to": 65.949}, {"content": "Maddie", "from": 65.949, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 25, "to": 66.269}, {"content": "提升实力的最佳途径", "from": 66.269, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 26, "to": 67.329}, {"content": "在Apex中提升瞄准需要大量研究和正确资源投入", "from": 67.329, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 27, "to": 73.64}, {"content": "如果你将我的视频视为提升Apex水平的机会", "from": 73.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 28, "to": 78.37}, {"content": "那这是积极的", "from": 78.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 29, "to": 79.45}, {"content": "我认为但这并非我的初衷", "from": 79.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 30, "to": 81.75}, {"content": "因此我希望在视频开头说明这一点", "from": 81.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 31, "to": 84.35}, {"content": "现在来看今天视频中的第三点", "from": 84.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 32, "to": 86.61}, {"content": "关于控场追踪的动作专业化", "from": 86.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 33, "to": 91.78}, {"content": "通过修正动作弱点", "from": 91.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 34, "to": 95.46}, {"content": "如何帮助我获得Nova", "from": 95.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 35, "to": 96.96}, {"content": "正如截图所示", "from": 96.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 36, "to": 98.98}, {"content": "我在高级赛季五中获得控场Nova", "from": 98.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 37, "to": 102.08}, {"content": "我尚未充分练习赛季五的场景", "from": 102.08, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 38, "to": 104.58}, {"content": "主要因为我经常玩蛇道", "from": 104.58, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 39, "to": 107.52}, {"content": "我超爱蛇道", "from": 107.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 40, "to": 108.68}, {"content": "很快我将拥有VT岩石控场", "from": 108.68, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 41, "to": 112.46}, {"content": "高级赛季五也将达到Nova", "from": 112.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 42, "to": 115.56}, {"content": "但目前Nova分数仅来自控场球", "from": 115.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 43, "to": 119.0}, {"content": "现在我们做一个简化说明", "from": 119.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 44, "to": 121.72}, {"content": "从20到30厘米射程", "from": 121.72, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 45, "to": 125.17}, {"content": "主要使用手腕和指尖", "from": 125.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 46, "to": 128.17}, {"content": "这里总会有例外情况", "from": 128.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 47, "to": 131.8}, {"content": "这就是简化的原因", "from": 131.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 48, "to": 133.78}, {"content": "但对于大多数人20到30厘米", "from": 133.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 49, "to": 136.08}, {"content": "主要使用手腕和指尖", "from": 136.08, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 50, "to": 138.74}, {"content": "从40厘米360到60厘米360范围内", "from": 138.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 51, "to": 142.98}, {"content": "这非常依赖手臂", "from": 142.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 52, "to": 144.74}, {"content": "当然还有手指尖", "from": 144.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 53, "to": 147.1}, {"content": "还有肩部", "from": 147.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 54, "to": 148.48}, {"content": "肘部和手臂", "from": 148.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 55, "to": 149.64}, {"content": "但手臂主导是40到60", "from": 149.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 56, "to": 152.58}, {"content": "然后70到90我们开始更多使用肩部", "from": 152.58, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 57, "to": 157.18}, {"content": "你会注意到肘部动作更明显", "from": 157.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 58, "to": 160.809}, {"content": "手臂在70到90范围内", "from": 160.809, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 59, "to": 162.689}, {"content": "对我来说", "from": 162.689, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 60, "to": 163.449}, {"content": "回到控制追踪", "from": 163.449, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 61, "to": 165.23}, {"content": "手腕和指尖是我主要的弱点", "from": 165.23, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 62, "to": 169.23}, {"content": "大量练习精准操作", "from": 169.23, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 63, "to": 170.75}, {"content": "手腕有很坏的习惯", "from": 170.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 64, "to": 172.84}, {"content": "我会锁死手腕无法灵活转向", "from": 172.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 65, "to": 176.97}, {"content": "但在10到30厘米360范围内", "from": 176.97, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 66, "to": 179.93}, {"content": "我的经验非常有限", "from": 179.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 67, "to": 181.77}, {"content": "我所有游戏都用低灵敏度", "from": 181.77, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 68, "to": 184.53}, {"content": "因此在10到30厘米360范围练习较少", "from": 184.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 69, "to": 189.56}, {"content": "这促使了你看到的训练列表", "from": 189.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 70, "to": 192.62}, {"content": "这一切始于中间那个", "from": 192.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 71, "to": 194.44}, {"content": "20厘米控制追踪", "from": 194.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 72, "to": 196.31}, {"content": "之后才扩展到其他项目", "from": 196.31, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 73, "to": 198.93}, {"content": "每个任务都有相同九项内容", "from": 198.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 74, "to": 201.71}, {"content": "大部分来自Amers Plus训练", "from": 201.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 75, "to": 204.65}, {"content": "但我们还修改了VT基准", "from": 204.65, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 76, "to": 207.87}, {"content": "我还为此制作了专属版本的Whisper", "from": 207.87, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 77, "to": 211.62}, {"content": "仔细观察", "from": 211.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 78, "to": 212.72}, {"content": "你会发现播放计数不同", "from": 212.72, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 79, "to": 214.7}, {"content": "在左侧", "from": 214.7, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 80, "to": 215.44}, {"content": "每个一次", "from": 215.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 81, "to": 216.63}, {"content": "在右侧", "from": 216.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 82, "to": 217.69}, {"content": "每个一次", "from": 217.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 83, "to": 218.65}, {"content": "而在中间", "from": 218.65, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 84, "to": 219.55}, {"content": "每个两次", "from": 219.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 85, "to": 220.67}, {"content": "这就是我选择的训练方式", "from": 220.67, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 86, "to": 223.19}, {"content": "这样不到一小时完成", "from": 223.19, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 87, "to": 225.41}, {"content": "之所以这样安排是因为", "from": 225.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 88, "to": 227.63}, {"content": "我的20厘米瞄准长期很差", "from": 227.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 89, "to": 231.75}, {"content": "特别是在20厘米360范围内", "from": 231.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 90, "to": 235.73}, {"content": "我需要最多练习", "from": 235.73, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 91, "to": 239.1}, {"content": "因此我为20厘米增加了更多时间", "from": 239.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 92, "to": 242.41}, {"content": "请不要将此视为通用建议", "from": 242.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 93, "to": 246.39}, {"content": "认为这就是必须做的", "from": 246.39, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 94, "to": 248.13}, {"content": "对于观看的你们", "from": 248.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 95, "to": 250.07}, {"content": "可能反而更有效", "from": 250.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 96, "to": 251.95}, {"content": "只需各练习一次", "from": 251.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 97, "to": 253.99}, {"content": "所以中间从两次改为一次", "from": 253.99, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 98, "to": 256.46}, {"content": "这样可在30分钟内完成列表", "from": 256.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 99, "to": 259.82}, {"content": "我保持了原样", "from": 259.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 100, "to": 261.64}, {"content": "然而", "from": 261.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 101, "to": 262.02}, {"content": "这样大家就能看到我在努力识别自己的不足之处", "from": 262.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 102, "to": 266.6}, {"content": "并努力改进那些我难以应对的环节", "from": 266.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 103, "to": 270.65}, {"content": "说到这里", "from": 270.65, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 104, "to": 271.77}, {"content": "我们现在就进入这些场景的具体情况", "from": 271.77, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 105, "to": 276.24}, {"content": "以及我对", "from": 276.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 106, "to": 278.12}, {"content": "好的", "from": 278.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 107, "to": 278.84}, {"content": "第一个场景这里是vt原始控制高级难度三五半径", "from": 278.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 108, "to": 283.5}, {"content": "现在看到的其实是我在30厘米处的打法", "from": 283.5, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 109, "to": 286.54}, {"content": "360度旋转我的得分会相当低", "from": 286.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 110, "to": 290.88}, {"content": "比10和20分低得多", "from": 290.88, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 111, "to": 293.43}, {"content": "原因在于这个机器人比其他两个版本更小", "from": 293.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 112, "to": 298.21}, {"content": "我认为30厘米并非我枪法的最大弱点", "from": 298.21, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 113, "to": 302.93}, {"content": "只是这些分数恰好较低", "from": 302.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 114, "to": 306.11}, {"content": "因为机器人更小", "from": 306.11, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 115, "to": 307.64}, {"content": "接下来看到的分数只是我的首次尝试", "from": 307.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 116, "to": 311.22}, {"content": "当你游玩这个歌单时", "from": 311.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 117, "to": 312.68}, {"content": "我已经多次练习并提升了这些分数", "from": 312.68, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 118, "to": 316.12}, {"content": "我想保留这些首次尝试的记录", "from": 316.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 119, "to": 319.06}, {"content": "让大家看到我的初始操作", "from": 319.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 120, "to": 322.76}, {"content": "同时也为大家提供更好的参考目标", "from": 322.76, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 121, "to": 326.13}, {"content": "回到原始控制具体分析", "from": 326.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 122, "to": 327.69}, {"content": "这是VT第五赛季基准", "from": 327.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 123, "to": 330.41}, {"content": "因为我知道我们会将机器人做得比默认更大", "from": 330.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 124, "to": 333.76}, {"content": "我希望它更灵活且难以锁定", "from": 333.76, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 125, "to": 338.9}, {"content": "岩石控制的射击效果非常好", "from": 338.9, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 126, "to": 341.06}, {"content": "因为它具备完整的XYZ移动能力", "from": 341.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 127, "to": 344.92}, {"content": "所以我在这方面非常吃力", "from": 344.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 128, "to": 347.479}, {"content": "但正如你看到我的30厘米得分", "from": 347.479, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 129, "to": 351.279}, {"content": "360度得分是2518", "from": 351.279, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 130, "to": 353.799}, {"content": "这是四", "from": 353.799, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 131, "to": 354.579}, {"content": "2%准确率", "from": 354.579, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 132, "to": 356.07}, {"content": "接下来是高级心形控制球的设置", "from": 356.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 133, "to": 360.97}, {"content": "因为它确实", "from": 360.97, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 134, "to": 362.78}, {"content": "这是一个官方VT基准", "from": 362.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 135, "to": 365.14}, {"content": "但长期以来一直是枪法高手的基准", "from": 365.14, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 136, "to": 367.96}, {"content": "有控制球和额外控制球", "from": 367.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 137, "to": 370.68}, {"content": "Clover为控制球的优秀枪法树立了标杆", "from": 371.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 138, "to": 376.34}, {"content": "但现在它成为第五赛季基准之一", "from": 376.34, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 139, "to": 379.62}, {"content": "至少高级赛季五的基准比常规控制球更快", "from": 379.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 140, "to": 386.82}, {"content": "尤其是这个高级难度版本", "from": 386.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 141, "to": 390.1}, {"content": "非常灵活且迫使你保持最佳状态", "from": 390.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 142, "to": 396.14}, {"content": "我的首次得分是2667", "from": 396.14, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 143, "to": 398.82}, {"content": "准确率接近45%", "from": 398.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 144, "to": 401.54}, {"content": "接下来是天使四伏泰克", "from": 401.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 145, "to": 404.419}, {"content": "这是来自伏泰克第二赛季的基准", "from": 404.419, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 146, "to": 408.499}, {"content": "也曾是伏泰克第三赛季的一部分", "from": 408.499, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 147, "to": 411.79}, {"content": "因为它们完全相同", "from": 411.79, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 148, "to": 413.63}, {"content": "屏幕上显示的版本", "from": 413.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 149, "to": 415.37}, {"content": "实际上是精英版的尺寸调整", "from": 415.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 150, "to": 418.159}, {"content": "而精英版是赛季三伏特基准测试的更新且更具挑战性的版本", "from": 418.159, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 151, "to": 425.11}, {"content": "我特别喜欢这个版本", "from": 425.11, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 152, "to": 427.69}, {"content": "所以致敬ness", "from": 431.87, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 153, "to": 433.01}, {"content": "她的瞄准能力非常惊人", "from": 433.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 154, "to": 434.41}, {"content": "你可以通过推特或X查看她的所有播放列表", "from": 434.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 155, "to": 438.07}, {"content": "正如它所称的", "from": 438.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 156, "to": 438.71}, {"content": "现在", "from": 438.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 157, "to": 439.13}, {"content": "她为希望全面提升的玩家准备了优秀的播放列表", "from": 439.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 158, "to": 444.04}, {"content": "我在这个关卡的初始得分是2853", "from": 444.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 159, "to": 446.64}, {"content": "换算下来接近四", "from": 446.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 160, "to": 448.38}, {"content": "八成准确率", "from": 448.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 161, "t