方法的人", "from": 694.499, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 262, "to": 696.479}, {"content": "希望你们能成为自己的亚里士多德", "from": 696.479, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 263, "to": 700.079}, {"content": "并在各方面超越我", "from": 700.079, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 264, "to": 703.35}, {"content": "这挺酷的", "from": 703.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 265, "to": 704.15}, {"content": "也", "from": 704.15, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 266, "to": 704.41}, {"content": "因为亚里士多德造就了亚历山大大帝", "from": 704.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 267, "to": 707.44}, {"content": "所以形成了这种奇特的传承", "from": 707.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 268, "to": 709.84}, {"content": "从苏格拉底到柏拉图再到亚里士多德，最终到亚历山大大帝", "from": 709.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 269, "to": 714.709}, {"content": "师承关系非常深远", "from": 714.709, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 270, "to": 717.38}, {"content": "尽管他们的追求各不相同", "from": 717.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 271, "to": 719.66}, {"content": "比如亚历山大大帝是征服者", "from": 719.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 272, "to": 722.63}, {"content": "某种程度上亚里士多德可能对他选择的道路感到失望", "from": 722.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 273, "to": 727.57}, {"content": "但无论如何他们都极具历史意义", "from": 727.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 274, "to": 731.48}, {"content": "总之", "from": 731.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 275, "to": 732.12}, {"content": "我讲了这么多历史", "from": 732.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 276, "to": 734.52}, {"content": "我只是想说", "from": 734.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 277, "to": 735.64}, {"content": "再次感谢", "from": 735.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 278, "to": 736.34}, {"content": "感谢大家近期对频道的支持", "from": 736.34, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 279, "to": 738.94}, {"content": "这真的很棒", "from": 738.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 280, "to": 740.18}, {"content": "我只想确保大家知道", "from": 740.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 281, "to": 743.26}, {"content": "我非常感激你们的评论和持续关注频道", "from": 743.26